        "id": "end-and-revoke",
        "text": "Ending the hire stops board preparation; it does not revoke a live delegation. A worker can redeem directly until expiry unless the creator sends `disableDelegation`.\n\n`revoke_budget` stops preparation and returns that disable transaction. Verify its receipt. Keep expiries short and revoke after the job ends if the delegation remains live.\n\nSee gas sponsorship for the separate zero-value relay grant."
